  "summary": "Hello! I'm Gabby, a passionate Front-End and WordPress Developer with over six years of experience specializing in technologies like TailWind CSS, Node.js, PHP, and React. I thrive in enhancing user experiences and streamlining web development processes through innovative and strategic implementations.\n\nAt Hopeworks, I lead a talented team of developers, applying Agile methodologies and trauma-informed practices to nurture their technical and soft skills. My commitment extends beyond project management, focusing on mentoring and promoting a balanced work/life culture. I'm currently pursuing a Disciplined Agile® Scrum Master (DASM) Certification to deepen my project leadership capabilities.\n\nLet’s connect and explore how we can create impactful and accessible digital experiences together!",
